  "findings": [
    "Document/PageDescriptor/PageProgram/ResourceCache pointer identity validated directly, no Document deep clone.",
    "ICC handles are separate per job; original ICC bytes and lazy LUTs shared. Four intents, BPC namespace isolation, custom RGB profile, pixel parity verified.",
    "Close/drop/save-over invalidate prepared jobs; retired cache budget zero blocks late inserts. Independent cancellation and tiny resource/raster budget cases verified.",
    "First ABBA pair times 1475-1515 ms serial, 1347-1360 ms concurrent. Final repeat 1790-2173 ms serial, 2718-2748 ms concurrent. Timing stability not established; no claim of >=16GB non-regression.",
